{"answer": "Here is a summary of the news in 59 words:

A helicopter crash in Malaysia killed six people, including the country's former ambassador to the US and a high-ranking PM staff member. Prime Minister Najib ordered an investigation and praised the victims as dedicated public servants. The helicopter's flight recorder was found in good condition, and a preliminary report is expected within a week.", "source_windows": [{"index": 0, "start": 0, "end": 228, "text": "A helicopter crash Saturday in Malaysia killed six people, including the nation's former ambassador to the United States and a high-ranking member of the prime minister's staff, the Malaysian state news agency Bernama reported. "}, {"index": 1, "start": 228, "end": 301, "text": "The helicopter crashed near Kampung Pasir Baru in Semenyih, at 4:55 p.m. "}, {"index": 2, "start": 301, "end": 321, "text": "Saturday (4:55 a.m. "}, {"index": 3, "start": 321, "end": 340, "text": "ET), Bernama said. "}, {"index": 4, "start": 340, "end": 393, "text": "Prime Minister Najib Razak ordered an investigation. "}, {"index": 5, "start": 393, "end": 589, "text": "Among the victims were Azlin Alias, who worked on the prime minister's staff, and Jamaluddin Jarjis, former Malaysian ambassador to the United States and chairman of PR1MA Malaysia, Bernama said. "}, {"index": 6, "start": 589, "end": 654, "text": "PR1MA is an organization that develops housing in urban centers. "}, {"index": 7, "start": 654, "end": 820, "text": ""We have lost two figures who had made great contributions to the government, party and country in this tragedy," Najib told reporters after visiting the crash site. "}, {"index": 8, "start": 820, "end": 942, "text": "Jamaluddin Jarjis was "a person of high caliber, who had sacrificed much for the government, party and country," he said. "}, {"index": 9, "start": 942, "end": 1115, "text": ""He had many acquaintances here and abroad." The state news agency called Azlin the prime minister's private secretary general, but Najib referred to him as chief of staff. "}, {"index": 10, "start": 1115, "end": 1247, "text": ""Personally he had agreed to leave his career in the corporate sector to serve the government as his national service," Najib said. "}, {"index": 11, "start": 1247, "end": 1354, "text": "The helicopter's flight recorder has been found in good condition, Bernama reported Sunday, citing police. "}, {"index": 12, "start": 1354, "end": 1489, "text": "The news agency said Malaysian civil aviation authorities are expected to release a preliminary report on the crash within seven days. "}, {"index": 13, "start": 1489, "end": 1537, "text": "CNN's Jethro Mullen contributed to this report.
"}]}
